  "description": "A terminal emulator control for your app, compatible with VT100, VT220, and xterm escape sequences. Feed it bytes from any source - an SSH session, a local process, a serial port - and it handles colors, scrollback, keyboard input, resizing, text selection, and clipboard copy/paste for you. Rendering uses the same text engine as the rest of the toolkit, with a bundled monospace font by default.",
